Feral Quickbox Dashboard

This project is inspired by the QuickBox Lite dashboard:
https://github.com/amefs/quickbox-lite

QuickBox Lite is a separate upstream project by its respective copyright
holders and is licensed under GNU GPL v3 or later. This repository is not
affiliated with Feral Hosting or the QuickBox Lite maintainers.

No upstream source files (including QuickBox/QB Classic dashboard code or assets) are copied; the layout and feature set are re-implemented independently. Any later
adaptation of upstream source must preserve applicable copyright notices
and comply with the upstream GPL license.


QuickBox Lite UI assets included in this Feral edition:
- public/assets/quickbox-defaulted.css and public/assets/quickbox-smoked.css
  are derived from the QuickBox Lite theme styles:
  https://github.com/amefs/quickbox-lite/tree/master/setup/themes
  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later (upstream header preserved).
- public/assets/resources.svg and public/img/logo-light.png and
  public/fonts/glyphicons-halflings-regular.woff2 are sourced from the
  QuickBox Lite dashboard distribution; see the upstream repository and its
  GPL-3.0-or-later license.
- Google Fonts imports were removed from the vendored CSS. System font
  fallbacks are used to avoid third-party font requests.
- QuickBox Lite's React/WebSocket backend, privileged package scripts and
  root-level service operations are not included. Feral authentication,
  metrics, process ownership checks and service allow-list remain rootless.
